	(text "AS5047P 3.3 V operation: VDD and VDD3V3 tied to 3.3 V, one 100 nF (DS000324 Fig. 10).\nTEST (pin 5) to GND per pin table. ABI / UVW / PWM outputs unused.\nSPI mode 1, up to 10 MHz, on its own SPI port (SPI3).\nPlace alone on the motor-facing side at the board center. Magnet 6 x 2.5 mm diametric,\ngap 1 to 2 mm. Keep phase and pass-through currents >= 12 mm away."
